pect to the progress of the winding up of the company in such form and manner as may be prescribed. (2) The Tribunal may, on an application by the Company Liquidator, review the orders made by it and make such modifications as it thinks fit. 289. [Power of Tribunal on application for stay of winding up.] Omitted by the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code, 2016 (31 of 2016), s. 255 and the Eleventh Schedule (w.e.f. 15-11-2016).

