378A. Definitions.— In this Chapter, unless the context otherwise requires,—

(a) “active Member” means a Member who fulfils the quantum and period of patronage of the Producer Company as may be required by the articles;

(b) “Chief Executive” means an individual appointed as such under sub-section (1) of section 378W;

(c) “inter-State co-operative society” means a multi-State co-operative society as defined in clause (p) of section 3 of the Multi-State Co-operative Societies Act, 2002 (39 of 2002) and includes any co-

